abstract: >-
  Small, self-contained bio-imaging and bioinformatics methods. Each tile stands
  alone, runs in a minute, and answers one question — this method against the
  established one, on a synthetic example, with one before/after figure.
keywords:
  - calcium imaging
  - two-photon microscopy
  - image registration
  - motion correction
  - signal processing
